# Diamond Si (F d -3 m origin choice 2, Si on 8a). Fixture for
# test_cif_reader_symmetry.cpp: an ICSD-style record, the H-M symbol with
# ICSD's origin suffix ('F d -3 m Z', origin choice 2), the number 227 and
# all 192 operators of F d -3 m:2 (48 point operations, then the same with
# each F-centring translation), which agree; Si1 at (1/8,1/8,1/8) gives the
# 8 atoms of the cell and the record is consistent once the suffix is read
# as ':2'. The operators are gemmi's F d -3 m:2 (Hall -F 4vw 2vw 3).
